### RAZ API Scratch
### Use with the REST Client extension.

### Ollama health and model list
GET http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/tags

### Ollama quick generate
POST http://127.0.0.1:11434/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "llama3",
  "prompt": "Summarize the current RAZ workspace health in one paragraph.",
  "stream": false
}

### Add project-specific endpoints below this line as they are introduced.